\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-315\li540\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  O Perfect Love, all human thought transcending,
\par \pard\li540\sl190\slmult0\qj Lowly we kneel in prayer before Thy throne,
\par That theirs may be the love which knows no ending
\par Whom Thou for evermore dost join in one.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li540\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.  O perfect Life, be Thou their full assurance
\par \pard\li540\sl190\slmult0\qj Of tender charity and steadfast faith,
\par Of  patience  hope  and quiet brave endurance,
\par With childlike trust that fears nor pain nor death.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li540\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.   Grant them the joy which brightens earthly sorrow;
\par \pard\li540\sl190\slmult0 Grant them the peace which calms all earthly strife,
\par And to life's day the glorious unknown morrow
\par \pard         That dawns upon eternal love and life.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

